# Phrolova Kernel — Xiaomi Redmi 10 2022 (selene)

Custom **Linux 4.14.357** kernel for Redmi 10 2022 (MediaTek Helio G88 / MT6768).
Performance-first, stability-tested on device. **Single universal build** — works on
MIUI/HyperOS and AOSP-based ROMs (LineageOS, crDroid, etc.).

## Features

- **ReSukiSU root** (manual hook, non-GKI 4.14) — multi-manager support (ReSukiSU / KernelSU / MKSU / RKSU / SukiSU-Ultra managers)
- **NoMount** systemless path redirection (v20, keyring-based) — module v2.0.0+ required
- **TCP BBR** congestion control (default; vendor BIC override neutralized)
- **ZRAM ZSTD** swap (4GB, level 5)
- **Deadline I/O scheduler** default (optimal for eMMC 5.1 legacy block layer)
- **Kprofiles** sysfs power profile manager + **Simple LMK** v1.0.3
- **FPSGO v3** gaming framework, Kernel Mode NEON crypto, TTL target (hotspot fix)
- **WireGuard** support, Droidspaces container-runtime compatible

## Security Posture

Perf-first kernel: FORTIFY_SOURCE, HARDENED_USERCOPY, STRICT_KERNEL_RWX, VMAP_STACK,
SECCOMP enabled. Spectre mitigations and slab hardening are deliberately off —
several hardening configs crash MTK vendor drivers (documented in AGENTS.md).
CVE tracking: [docs/CVE-INVENTORY.md](docs/CVE-INVENTORY.md).

## Build (Greenforce Clang 24.0.0)

```bash
# Deps
sudo apt-get install -y bc bison build-essential flex \
  libssl-dev libelf-dev zstd python3 \
  binutils-aarch64-linux-gnu gcc-aarch64-linux-gnu zip

# Toolchain
bash <(wget -qO- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/greenforce-project/greenforce_clang/refs/heads/main/get_clang.sh)
export PATH="$(pwd)/greenforce-clang/bin:$PATH"

# ReSukiSU symlink (required before build)
ln -sf "$(realpath resukisu/kernel)" drivers/kernelsu

# Build
make O=out ARCH=arm64 CC=clang HOSTCC=gcc \
  CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu- selene_defconfig
make O=out ARCH=arm64 CC=clang HOSTCC=gcc \
  CROSS_COMPILE=aarch64-linux-gnu- -j$(nproc)
```

Output: `out/arch/arm64/boot/Image.gz` → packaged as `Phrolova-selene-{tag}.zip`.

## Flash

1. Bootloader **unlocked** (UBL) — required.
2. Download the latest `Phrolova-selene-*.zip` from
   [Releases](../../releases) (or Telegram channel).
3. Flash via custom recovery (TWRP/OrangeFox) or `adb reboot recovery` +
   AnyKernel3 zip. A/B slot aware (`block=auto`).
4. Install a matching manager: ReSukiSU manager (recommended —
   [nightly.link build-manager](https://nightly.link/ReSukiSU/ReSukiSU/workflows/build-manager/main)
   / t.me/ReSukiSU) or any multi-manager build.
5. NoMount users: install **NoMount module v2.0.0+** (v1.x uses netlink detection
   → false negative on v20 kernels). Verify: `nm version` returns `20`.

## CI/CD

GitHub Actions builds on push to `phrolova` (docs-only pushes skipped).
Versioning: nightly `v{base}-nightly.YYYYMMDD` / stable `v{base}` / hotfix `v{base+1}`
via `.github/scripts/version.sh`. Telegram notifications on start/success/fail.

